  "title": "Graham Holdings Company Announces Proposed $500 Million Private Offering of Senior Notes",
  "summary": "ARLINGTON, Va. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Nov. 12, 2025-- Graham Holdings Company (NYSE: GHC) (the Company) today announced that it intends to offer, subject to market and other conditions, $500 million in aggregate principal amount of its senior unsecured notes due 2033 (the Notes).",
